---
sequenceDiagram
    participant Worker
    participant Pipeline
    participant Plugins as Plugin Hooks
    participant AI as AI Service
    participant Registry
    participant EntityResolver as Entity Resolver
    participant JobSteps as Job Steps Log

    Note over Worker,JobSteps: Pipeline Execution Flow

    Worker->>Pipeline: Execute(context)

    Pipeline->>JobSteps: CREATE step<br/>name='preprocessing',<br/>status='running'

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Parse hints from input
    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Infer type/subtype

    Pipeline->>JobSteps: UPDATE step='preprocessing'<br/>status='completed'

    loop For each task in pipeline
        Pipeline->>JobSteps: CREATE step<br/>name=task.name,<br/>status='running'

        Pipeline->>Plugins: Emit BeforePipelineTask(task)
        Plugins-->>Pipeline: Continue

        alt Task requires AI
            Pipeline->>AI: Enrich content<br/>(summarize, classify, extract)
            AI-->>Pipeline: AI response
        end

        alt Task is mention extraction
            Pipeline->>Pipeline: Extract @mentions from text
            Pipeline->>EntityResolver: Resolve mentions
            activate EntityResolver
            EntityResolver->>Registry: GET /entities/{id}
            Registry-->>EntityResolver: Entity definition
            EntityResolver-->>Pipeline: Resolved entities +<br/>unresolved mentions
            deactivate EntityResolver
        end

        alt Task is tag alignment
            Pipeline->>Registry: GET /taxonomy
            Registry-->>Pipeline: Tag definitions
            Pipeline->>Registry: GET /weights
            Registry-->>Pipeline: Tag weights
            Pipeline->>Pipeline: Normalize and weight tags
        end

        Pipeline->>Plugins: Emit AfterPipelineTask(task, result)
        Plugins-->>Pipeline: Plugin metadata updates

        Pipeline->>JobSteps: UPDATE step<br/>status='completed',<br/>log='...'
    end

    Pipeline->>Pipeline: Assemble bookmark from<br/>all task outputs

    Pipeline->>Plugins: Emit PostPipelineExecute(bookmark)
    Plugins-->>Pipeline: Additional plugin data

    Pipeline-->>Worker: Final bookmark +<br/>optional follow-up jobs

    Note over Worker,JobSteps: Pipeline complete.<br/>Worker writes bookmark<br/>and marks job completed.
```
